---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Privacy Policy - Munex" description="Privacy Policy for Munex. How I collect, use, and protect your information." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article>
				<div class="prose">
					<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
					<p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

					<p>
						At Munex, I take your privacy seriously. This policy explains what information I collect, 
						why I collect it, and how I use it. Written in plain English, not legalese.
					</p>

					<h2>What I Collect</h2>
					
					<h3>Information You Provide</h3>
					<p>If you email me at support@munex.in, I'll have your email address and whatever you write in your message. I use this only to respond to you.</p>

					<h3>Automatic Information</h3>
					<p>Like most websites, Munex collects some data automatically:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Pages you visit and how long you stay</li>
						<li>Your general location (country/city level, not precise)</li>
						<li>Device type and browser</li>
						<li>How you found the site (search engine, direct link, etc.)</li>
					</ul>
					<p>This helps me understand what content is useful and how to improve the site.</p>

					<h2>Analytics</h2>
					<p>
						I use privacy-friendly analytics to understand how people use Munex. 
						This data is aggregated—I see trends, not individual users.
					</p>

					<h2>Advertising</h2>
					<p>
						Munex displays ads through Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to show you relevant ads 
						based on your browsing history. You can opt out of personalized ads at 
						<a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
					</p>

					<h2>Cookies</h2>
					<p>Munex uses cookies for:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Analytics (understanding site usage)</li>
						<li>Advertising (showing relevant ads)</li>
					</ul>
					<p>You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though some features may not work properly.</p>

					<h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
					<p>
						My reviews link to external software products. Once you click those links, 
						you're on their sites with their privacy policies. I can't control what they do with your data.
					</p>

					<h2>Your Rights</h2>
					<p>You can:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Ask what data I have about you (probably just your email if you've contacted me)</li>
						<li>Request deletion of your data</li>
						<li>Opt out of personalized advertising</li>
					</ul>
					<p>Email <a href="mailto:support@munex.in">support@munex.in</a> for any privacy-related requests.</p>

					<h2>Data Security</h2>
					<p>
						I use industry-standard security practices. The site runs on HTTPS. 
						I don't store sensitive data like passwords or payment information.
					</p>

					<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
					<p>Munex isn't intended for children under 13. I don't knowingly collect data from minors.</p>

					<h2>Changes</h2>
					<p>
						If I update this policy, I'll change the date at the top. 
						For significant changes, I'll add a notice on the homepage.
					</p>

					<h2>Questions?</h2>
					<p>
						Email me at <a href="mailto:support@munex.in">support@munex.in</a> with any privacy questions or concerns.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
		<style>
			main {
				width: calc(100% - 2em);
				max-width: 100%;
				margin: 0;
			}
			.prose {
				width: 720px;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
				margin: auto;
				padding: 2em 1em;
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
			}
			.prose h1 {
				font-size: 2.5em;
				margin-bottom: 0.5em;
			}
			.prose h2 {
				font-size: 1.4em;
				margin-top: 2em;
				margin-bottom: 0.5em;
			}
			.prose h3 {
				font-size: 1.1em;
				margin-top: 1.5em;
			}
			.prose ul {
				padding-left: 1.5em;
			}
			.prose li {
				margin-bottom: 0.5em;
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
